<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Datacraft appoints Roberts new CFO.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Datacraft appoints Roberts new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecommunications group Datacraft Ltd said on Thursday it had appointed Hilary Roberts to the position of chief financial officer (CFO) and company secretary after the retirement of current CFO Mike Stockdale.</p>
<p>Roberts is leaving retailer Coles Myer Ltd, where he has been general manager of finance for K-Mart Australia for the past four years.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
